>        My question is this; "How/where do I find the amulet?"

Here's the problem:  In hack (yes, hack, not nethack) there are NO down
stairways after level 27.  The only way to get down lower is to use a
level teleport, which does exist (always has, always will).  This is
accomplished by having the following:  teleport control, a *scroll* of
teleport (must be a scroll), and a potion of confusion.

Quaff the potion of confusion, read the scroll of teleport, and it will
ask you what level to teleport to.  I'm pretty sure that it's usually
level 36 that the wizard's on in hack, but it's been a while since I've
played, so you might want to play it safe and go for level 40 (and get
some extra points on your way up).

Hope this helps.

